951 to 2025, on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids. January to February came in under 90% of normal in 36 of those years, more than any other pair. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 35% of normal in August to September and 42% in September to October. Every grid had its driest year in 1963, and grid 24477 got 68% of normal that year.</p>"}
